"# Ordered Lists\n\nNon-list line.\n1. First item.\n2. Second item.\n3. Third item.\n\nNow let's try interrupting the list but not adding a blank line after this.\n4. Fourth item.\n5. Fifth item.\n\nNow let's try a list in a quote block.\n\n> This is my first list\\.\n> \n> 1\\. List item\\.\n> 2\\. List item\\.\n> 3\\. List item\\.\n> \n> Interruption\\.\n> \n> 4\\. List item\\.\n> 5\\. List item\\.\n> \n> Now we try it without the blank line\\.\n> 1\\. List item\\.\n> 2\\. List item\\.\n> \n> And we're done\\.\n\nSo done."
